[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4262.83, "timestamp": "01:11:02", "text": "嗯嗯，我們有星期一是可燃垃圾日，星期二不行，星期三是塑膠容器日等等。有時候會有可重複利用垃圾日。  以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4266.55, "timestamp": "01:11:06", "text": "所有的一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4269.03, "timestamp": "01:11:09", "text": "所以，是的，你必須把垃圾和其他所有東西都分開"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4272.03, "timestamp": "01:11:12", "text": "。這是一項非常繁重的工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4286.07, "timestamp": "01:11:26", "text": "有趣的新聞和購物場所真的很棒，是的，我的同事們都很友善。他們是長輩。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4294.027, "timestamp": "01:11:34", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm will try to drop by whenever possible"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4294.79, "timestamp": "01:11:34", "text": "嗯，他們一直在教我如何做好這份工作等等，嗯，人真的很好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4298.51, "timestamp": "01:11:38", "text": "。 [音樂]我總是……嗯，是的，就我而言，我其實從來沒見過我工作的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4299.107, "timestamp": "01:11:39", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/8gF1Xp_zK8jk8gSDrI2wCwUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/8gF1Xp_zK8jk8gSDrI2wCw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4300.59, "timestamp": "01:11:40", "text": "老闆，也就是CEO，因為他生病了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4305.95, "timestamp": "01:11:45", "text": "所以是另一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4309.99, "timestamp": "01:11:49", "text": "員工助理面試了"}]